    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-early",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "先用狂铁过渡，把钦定主角给狂铁后再打出英雄或效果牌；优先狂铁觉醒，弈星、牛魔各一张按战力补，必要时干将提高保血。第一轮拍卖优先亚连，其次云中君、瑶；不在2级、3级花大量资源停留。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 475.12,
          "end": 635.06
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-middle",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "升4级集中寻找韩信及成长组件，首张韩信到手前不大量买效果牌。封神一瞬先留手，韩信到场后先指定钦定主角，再使用封神一瞬，然后打牌、效果牌触发成长，避免漏掉前面的收益。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 635.39,
          "end": 715.38
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-late",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "当轮钦定主角成长达到上限后可暂存非急用牌，利用雅典娜等自动成长。升5级准备太乙真人，缺人口时先留手保住打出位置；场面能稳住后升6级开完美演出，再按实际控制威胁调整免控装备。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 716.25,
          "end": 887.13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-hero-1501",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**韩信：** 主要输出，频繁开团、整备提高永久等级，觉醒提高成长速度，第三轮可借天籁琴音补关键觉醒。等级越高越有利于面板与收割，仍需保证攻速启动和生存。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 389.88,
          "end": 447.6
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-hero-5141",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**亚连：** 整备定向给主力成长，优先觉醒取得双次整备，避免用随机分配工具替代定向成长后丢失确定收益。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 552.66,
          "end": 606.79
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-hero-5031",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**狂铁：** 前期主要战力与整备成员，优先觉醒；阿科米亚核心积累可用跳级回收给非日落海的韩信。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 304.8,
          "end": 362.38
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-hero-5061",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**云中君：** 开团提供装备相关等级，与韩信开团成长及封神一瞬联动；优先保证实际装备覆盖。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 552.66,
          "end": 606.79
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-hero-5051",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**瑶：** 开团触发成长并保护韩信，40级控制在后期单挑有价值；未达到100级时不为属性分享强行配置装备。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 579.44,
          "end": 635.06
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
        "snapshot": "knowledge/reviews/22份文字稿融合-2026-10-22.json"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b22-b22-prep-hanxin-owner-hero-1831",
      "section": "英雄",
      "text": "**雅典娜：** 配合其他整备英雄提供自动成长；当轮手牌已打完后补入，避免占满打牌空间。",
      "condition": "",
      "version": null,
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "source": "BV1H7aP6FEgZ:p1",
          "start": 686.06,
          "end": 742.88
        }
      ],
      "review_basis": {
